cff-version: 1.2.0
title: inceptools
message: >-
  If you use this framework in work you publish, please cite it.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Singla
    given-names: Ishan
repository-code: "https://github.com/IncepTools/python"
url: "https://inceptools.github.io/python/"
abstract: >-
  An opinionated application framework for Python services, on top of FastAPI:
  modules with enforced encapsulation, typed dependency injection, guards,
  interceptors, one response envelope, a tenant-scoped data layer, scheduling,
  locks, idempotency and a transactional outbox.
keywords:
  - python
  - fastapi
  - framework
  - dependency-injection
  - architecture
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
